OL,3,GNEWSASection of M20 reopens after crash
OL,4,Aand fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FA section of the M20's eastbound
OL,7,Fcarriageway has reopened after it was
OL,8,Fclosed following a crash.
OL,10,FThe motorway in Kent had been shut
OL,11,Fbetween junction eight (Lenham) and
OL,12,Fjunction nine (Ashford) for several
OL,13,Fhours on Wednesday due to a "collision
OL,14,Fand car fire", National Highways said.
OL,16,FKent Police said it was called shortly
OL,17,Fbefore 06:00 BST and that the crash had
OL,18,Finvolved one vehicle.
OL,20,FThe road reopened after recovery and
OL,21,Finvestigation work at the scene was
OL,22,Fcompleted.
